149	 * The generic runner does not inspect it — that is the contract
150	 * `WitnessApplicationJourneyEvidence` states — so it is the right place for
151	 * facts only this synthesis can express, and it participates in the behaviour
152	 * digest, which is what makes a lane that synthesized something different
153	 * unable to agree with its own pair.
154	 */
